## Esri-family chip icons

`assets/esri/` and `dist/icons/esri/` ship **MIT-original** product-role glyphs for `esri.*` kinds (white strokes on Esri-blue chips).

These are **not** Esri or ArcGIS trademark logos. Replace with a licensed icon pack when you have one (same filenames; see `assets/esri/README.md`).

## AWS / Azure chip icons

Same pattern under `assets/aws/`, `assets/azure/`, and `dist/icons/{aws,azure}/` — MIT-original glyphs for `aws.*` / `azure.*` kinds (not Amazon or Microsoft trademark artwork). Regenerate with `node scripts/gen-cloud-icons.js`.
